# _error.js

For server errors (500), create a **`_error.js`** file in `pages/`. It receives a `statusCode` prop.

```jsx
// pages/_error.js
function Error({ statusCode }) {
  return (
    <p>
      {statusCode
        ? `An error ${statusCode} occurred on server`
        : 'An error occurred on client'}
    </p>
  );
}
```

This catches both client and server errors.
